## StartStreaming
D geometry
H begin
D prepare rate=48000 cap=1[1] play=1[0]
H reserve playback allowed=ffffffffffffffff bw=308 -> ch=0
H reserve capture allowed=ffffffffffffffff bw=308 -> ch=1
D assign cap=1[1] play=1[0]
H prepare rx ch=1 fmt=0 slots=9 pcm=0
H prepare tx ch=0 sid=0 @s400
D health
D health
D health
H start rx
D program rx
H start tx
D program tx+enable
D confirm
## -> 0x00000000 streaming=1
## StopStreaming
D disconnect playback
H stop tx
D disconnect capture
H stop rx
H stop all
## -> 0x00000000 streaming=0
## RecoverStreaming timing-loss
## -> 0xe00002c7 streaming=0
